cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "INDOTERM-Julia: a Julia translation of the INDOTERM multi-region CGE model of Indonesia"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Robiyan
    given-names: Ahmad
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # TODO: add ORCID
repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmadrobiyan/Indoterm_Julia"
abstract: >-
  A Julia translation of INDOTERM, a TERM-family, ORANI-G-derived multi-region
  computable general equilibrium model of Indonesia, ported from its original
  GEMPACK/TABLO source and solved in levels with a sparse Newton method. Base
  data are the 2016 Indonesia input-output table with regional supplementary
  data (185 commodities x 34 provinces), solved at 25 sectors x 6 island groups.
keywords:
  - computable general equilibrium
  - CGE
  - Indonesia
  - TERM
  - ORANI-G
  - regional economics
  - Julia
license: MIT
references:
  - type: software
    title: "TERM: The Enormous Regional Model"
    authors:
      - family-names: Horridge
        given-names: Mark
    notes: >-
      Original GEMPACK/TABLO model that INDOTERM derives from; source
      redistributed under origin/ (see NOTICE for its separate terms).
